<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;color:#111827;">You're invited to {{institutionName}}</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
  You have been invited to join <strong>{{institutionName}}</strong> on the institution management portal.
  Click the button below to set your password and activate your account.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;">
  <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:{{primaryColor}};color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;">
    Accept invitation
  </a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">
  If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br />
  <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" style="color:{{primaryColor}};word-break:break-all;">{{inviteUrl}}</a>
</p>
